    grammarFocus: "B1 Level Review (B1 Kapsamlı Genel Tekrar)",
    englishText: "The big day has finally arrived for the small village. Mr. Lane and the boy have been preparing for this exact moment for months. If they hadn't worked so hard together, this beautiful museum wouldn't have opened today. The villagers, who are waiting excitedly outside the gates, are very happy. To make everything perfect, Mr. Lane had the old doors painted and got the garden cleaned by professionals. The village leader gave a speech and said that he was proud of everyone. 'I wish my grandfather were here to see this beautiful crowd,' whispered Mr. Lane with tears in his eyes. The boy smiled warmly and said, 'He must be watching us right now from above.' Now, it is time to open the doors to the world.",
