    englishText: "The library was perfectly silent, holding its breath. On the wooden table lay the ancient pocket watch, reflecting the morning sun. Inside the watch was a meticulously folded piece of paper, yellowed with age. Little did they know that this single paper would change everything they believed about the house. The young man held his breath and opened it using a pair of tweezers. Out from the fragile paper fell a tiny, incredibly detailed architectural map of the Wisdom Tower. 'Seldom have I seen such precise engineering,' whispered the young man in absolute shock. Only by looking closely could they see the microscopic structural lines drawn in ink.",
